{
  "name": "LearnViaNotes",
  "version": 2,
  "description": "Platform-neutral design tokens for the LearnViaNotes web and mobile apps (ADR-0114, unslop direction: a study desk, ruled paper, pen ink, a yellow highlighter). color.base is the warm-paper neutral ramp, status colours and the highlighter (spark). color.themes overrides the brand for each accent, in light and dark. Default mode is system, default accent is ink. Spark is the signature highlighter: a flat marker stroke behind a key word, the active item and Nova's citations, never a fill for body text. No purple, violet, indigo, pink, hue-to-hue gradients, glows or sparkles.",
